{
 "An insurer in Nairobi puts a bot in front of customers. Question, retrieve, answer, cite, log, feedback.": "2fefe98d1c.mp3",
 "Five questions have no answer in the policies. Without a refusal rule, the bot invents cover.": "8583809df8.mp3",
 "Each claim must point to a clause. That keeps the model close to the text, and lets people check.": "bf7fbf1576.mp3",
 "Regulators ask what was said. Keep a record, with personal data removed first.": "2bebda1691.mp3",
 "When the bot refuses, a person takes the call. That handoff is part of the design.": "5bc0634c25.mp3",
 "What customers ask shows what the index lacks. Feed it back, and the ring turns.": "0dc1b6e0c7.mp3"
}
